{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788250967866,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_699e80a41b1c4cf0976e5d3b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868/soccer_mcp/normalize.py","content":"\"\"\"\nsoccer_mcp.normalize -- name, competition, date and position normalization.\n\nCONTEXT\n-------\nThis module implements the \"Data Quality\" requirements of the Brazilian Soccer\nMCP Server specification (TASK.md / brazilian-soccer-mcp-guide.md):\n\n* Team names appear in the six Kaggle CSV files under wildly different\n  conventions:\n      - with a state suffix ............. \"Palmeiras-SP\", \"América - MG\"\n      - without a suffix ................ \"Palmeiras\", \"Flamengo\"\n      - with dot-separated initials ..... \"A.b.c. - RN\", \"C.r.b. - AL\"\n      - with full legal names ........... \"Sport Club Corinthians Paulista\"\n      - with parenthetical remarks ...... \"Boavista Sport Club (antigo ...)\"\n      - foreign clubs with country tags . \"Nacional (URU)\", \"Barcelona-EQU\"\n  Every raw spelling must fold onto ONE canonical team id so that match\n  records from different files can be joined.\n\n* Dates appear as ISO (\"2023-09-24\"), ISO+time (\"2012-05-19 18:30:00\") and\n  Brazilian (\"29/03/2003\") formats, plus the sentinel \"NA\".\n\n* Competitions are referred to by many names (\"Brasileirão\", \"Serie A\",\n  \"Campeonato Brasileiro\", \"Copa do Brasil\", \"Libertadores\", ...).\n\nDESIGN\n------\n``parse_team_name`` decomposes a raw club name into ``(base, state, country)``\nvia a strict, order-sensitive pipeline (parenthetical extraction, country-tag\nextraction, trailing-UF extraction, accent folding, punctuation cleanup,\nsingle-letter-run collapsing).  An explicit ``ALIASES`` table then folds known\nhistorical/branding renames (e.g. \"Athletico Paranaense\" -> Atlético-PR,\n\"Grêmio Prudente\" -> Barueri).  States for *bare* famous names that cannot be\nderived from the data itself are supplied by ``FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS``; everything\nelse is auto-derived by the TeamRegistry in ``data_loader`` (two-pass\nregistration).  Canonical ids look like ``\"flamengo rj\"``, ``\"atletico pr\"``\nor ``\"nacional uru\"``.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport unicodedata\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom datetime import date, datetime\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Basic text helpers\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\ndef strip_accents(value: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Return ``value`` with combining marks removed (NFD + Mn filtering).\"\"\"\n    decomposed = unicodedata.normalize(\"NFD\", value)\n    return \"\".join(ch for ch in decomposed if unicodedata.category(ch) != \"Mn\")\n\n\ndef text_key(value: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Case/accent-insensitive lookup key used for fuzzy name search.\"\"\"\n    return re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", strip_accents(value).casefold()).strip()\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Team-name parsing\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n#: The 27 Brazilian federal-unit (UF) abbreviations.\nVALID_UFS = {\n    \"ac\", \"al\", \"ap\", \"am\", \"ba\", \"ce\", \"df\", \"es\", \"go\", \"ma\", \"mt\", \"ms\",\n    \"mg\", \"pa\", \"pb\", \"pr\", \"pe\", \"pi\", \"rj\", \"rn\", \"rs\", \"ro\", \"rr\", \"sc\",\n    \"sp\", \"se\", \"to\",\n}\n\n#: Full state names sometimes written in parentheses, e.g. \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\".\nSTATE_NAMES = {\n    \"minas gerais\": \"mg\",\n    \"sao paulo\": \"sp\",\n    \"rio de janeiro\": \"rj\",\n    \"rio grande do sul\": \"rs\",\n    \"rio grande do norte\": \"rn\",\n    \"santa catarina\": \"sc\",\n    \"bahia\": \"ba\",\n    \"ceara\": \"ce\",\n    \"goias\": \"go\",\n    \"para\": \"pa\",\n    \"parana\": \"pr\",\n    \"pernambuco\": \"pe\",\n    \"piaui\": \"pi\",\n    \"maranhao\": \"ma\",\n    \"mato grosso\": \"mt\",\n    \"mato grosso do sul\": \"ms\",\n    \"amazonas\": \"am\",\n    \"paraiba\": \"pb\",\n    \"sergipe\": \"se\",\n    \"alagoas\": \"al\",\n    \"espirito santo\": \"es\",\n    \"distrito federal\": \"df\",\n    \"acre\": \"ac\",\n    \"amapa\": \"ap\",\n    \"rondonia\": \"ro\",\n    \"roraima\": \"rr\",\n    \"tocantins\": \"to\",\n}\n\n#: South/Latin-American country codes used as suffixes in the Libertadores file.\nCOUNTRY_CODES = {\"uru\", \"par\", \"equ\", \"per\", \"ven\", \"arg\", \"chi\", \"col\", \"bol\", \"mex\", \"ecu\"}\n\n_RE_TRAILING_PAREN = re.compile(r\"\\(([^)]*)\\)\\s*$\")\n_RE_COUNTRY_SUFFIX = re.compile(r\"[-\\u2013]\\s*([A-Za-z]{3})$\")\n_RE_STATE_SUFFIX = re.compile(r\"(?:^|\\s|[-\\u2013])\\s*([A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$\")\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Decomposed raw club name.\"\"\"\n\n    base: str\n    state: str | None\n    country: str | None\n\n    @property\n    def team_id(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Canonical id: ``\"<base> <state|country>\"`` (or bare base).\"\"\"\n        suffix = self.state or self.country\n        return f\"{self.base} {suffix}\" if suffix else self.base\n\n\ndef _collapse_single_letter_runs(base: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Join consecutive single-letter tokens: ``\"c r b\" -> \"crb\"``.\n\n    Dot-separated abbreviations (\"C. R. B.\", \"A.b.c.\") lose their dots in\n    ``_clean_base`` and end up as runs of one-letter tokens; they must fold to\n    a single token so they match their undotted spellings (\"CRB\", \"ABC\").\n    \"\"\"\n    tokens = base.split(\" \")\n    out: list[str] = []\n    run: list[str] = []\n    for token in tokens:\n        if len(token) == 1:\n            run.append(token)\n            continue\n        if run:\n            out.append(\"\".join(run))\n            run = []\n        out.append(token)\n    if run:\n        out.append(\"\".join(run))\n    return \" \".join(out)\n\n\ndef _clean_base(raw: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Lowercase, accent-fold, punctuation-normalized club base name.\"\"\"\n    text = strip_accents(raw).casefold().strip()\n    text = text.replace(\".\", \"\")  # \"a.b.c.\" -> \"abc\", \"s.francisco\" -> \"sfrancisco\"\n    text = re.sub(r\"[^\\w\\s]\", \" \", text)  # hyphens, apostrophes, etc. -> spaces\n    text = re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", text).strip()\n    return _collapse_single_letter_runs(text)\n\n\ndef parse_team_name(raw: str) -> ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Decompose a raw club spelling into ``base`` / ``state`` / ``country``.\n\n    Order of operations (important -- suffixes must be peeled off before the\n    base is cleaned):\n\n    1. trailing parenthetical: a 2-letter UF (\"(PI)\"), a state name\n       (\"(Minas Gerais)\") or a country code (\"(URU)\") is promoted to\n       ``state``/``country``; anything else (e.g. \"(antigo Esporte Clube\n       Barreira)\") is dropped;\n    2. trailing ``-XXX`` country tag (\"Barcelona-EQU\");\n    3. trailing 2-letter UF (\"Palmeiras-SP\", \"América - MG\", \"Botafogo PB\").\n    \"\"\"\n    text = raw.strip()\n    state: str | None = None\n    country: str | None = None\n\n    match = _RE_TRAILING_PAREN.search(text)\n    if match:\n        inner = strip_accents(match.group(1)).casefold().strip()\n        text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n        if inner in VALID_UFS:\n            state = inner\n        elif inner in STATE_NAMES:\n            state = STATE_NAMES[inner]\n        elif inner in COUNTRY_CODES:\n            country = inner\n\n    if country is None:\n        match = _RE_COUNTRY_SUFFIX.search(text)\n        if match and match.group(1).casefold() in COUNTRY_CODES:\n            country = match.group(1).casefold()\n            text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n\n    if state is None and country is None:\n        match = _RE_STATE_SUFFIX.search(text)\n        if match and match.group(1).casefold() in VALID_UFS:\n            state = match.group(1).casefold()\n            text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n\n    return ParsedTeamName(base=_clean_base(text), state=state, country=country)\n\n\n#: Explicit folds for clubs whose *base* itself changes between sources.\n#: Keys are ``(base, state_or_None)``; a ``None`` state means \"any state\".\n#: Values are the canonical ``(base, state)``.  ``None`` result-state keeps the\n#: parsed state (used for pure base renames).\nALIASES: dict[tuple[str, str | None], tuple[str, str | None]] = {\n    # -- Atlético family -----------------------------------------------------\n    (\"atletico mineiro\", None): (\"atletico\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"atletico goianiense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"go\"),\n    (\"atletico paranaense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"athletico paranaense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"athletico\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),  # bare \"Athletico\" (Libertadores) = Athletico-PR\n    (\"atletico acreano\", None): (\"atletico\", \"ac\"),\n    (\"atletico alagoinhas\", None): (\"atletico\", \"ba\"),\n    # -- América family -------------------------------------------------------\n    (\"america fc\", \"mg\"): (\"america\", \"mg\"),  # FIFA \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\"\n    (\"america fc natal\", None): (\"america\", \"rn\"),\n    (\"america de natal\", None): (\"america\", \"rn\"),\n    # -- Rio / São Paulo classics ---------------------------------------------\n    (\"vasco\", None): (\"vasco da gama\", None),\n    (\"sport club corinthians paulista\", None): (\"corinthians\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sport recife\", None): (\"sport\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"sport club do recife\", None): (\"sport\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"gremio prudente\", None): (\"barueri\", \"sp\"),  # Barueri was renamed Grêmio Prudente in 2010\n    (\"gremio barueri\", None): (\"barueri\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"gremio novorizontino\", None): (\"novorizontino\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"bragantino\", None): (\"red bull bragantino\", \"sp\"),  # modern bare \"Bragantino\" = RB Bragantino-SP\n    (\"bragantino\", \"sp\"): (\"red bull bragantino\", \"sp\"),\n    # -- named clubs that drop their suffix elsewhere --------------------------\n    (\"ser caxias\", None): (\"caxias\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ceara sporting club\", None): (\"ceara\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"nautico capibaribe\", None): (\"nautico\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"santa cruz fc\", None): (\"santa cruz\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"ec vitoria\", None): (\"vitoria\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"vitoria ec\", None): (\"vitoria\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"ec juventude\", None): (\"juventude\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ec internacional\", \"sc\"): (\"internacional\", \"sc\"),\n    (\"portuguesa desportos\", None): (\"portuguesa\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"macae esporte\", None): (\"macae\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"esportivo bento goncalves\", None): (\"esportivo\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"boavista sport club\", None): (\"boavista\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"boavista sc saquarema\", None): (\"boavista\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"operario ferroviario esporte c\", None): (\"operario\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"operario fc\", \"ms\"): (\"operario\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"ceo varzeagrandense\", None): (\"operario\", \"ms\"),  # historic name of Operário-MS\n    (\"aquidauanense futebol clube\", None): (\"aquidauanense\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"parnahyba sc\", \"pi\"): (\"parnahyba\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"rio branco vn\", None): (\"rio branco\", \"es\"),\n    (\"independente de tucurui\", None): (\"independente\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"santa quiteria futebol clube\", None): (\"santa quiteria\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"sao domingos futebol clube\", None): (\"sao domingos\", \"se\"),\n    (\"arapongas esporte clube\", None): (\"arapongas\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"paulista futebol clube\", None): (\"paulista\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"desportiva ferroviaria\", None): (\"desportiva\", \"es\"),\n    (\"real noroeste capixaba\", None): (\"real noroeste\", \"es\"),\n    (\"flamengo do piaui\", None): (\"flamengo\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"fluminense de feira\", None): (\"fluminense\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"fortaleza fc\", None): (\"fortaleza\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"fortaleza ec\", None): (\"fortaleza\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"fluminense de feira\", None): (\"fluminense\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"vitoria fc\", \"es\"): (\"vitoria\", \"es\"),\n    (\"vitoria da conquista\", None): (\"vitoria da conquista\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"madureira ec\", None): (\"madureira\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"moto club de sao luis\", None): (\"moto club\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"moto clube\", None): (\"moto club\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"afogados da ingazeira\", None): (\"afogados\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"aguia\", \"pa\"): (\"aguia de maraba\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"ae altos\", None): (\"altos\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"ad confianca\", None): (\"confianca\", \"se\"),\n    (\"ad frei paulistano\", None): (\"frei paulistano\", \"se\"),\n    (\"amadense ec\", None): (\"amadense\", \"se\"),\n    (\"cordino ec\", None): (\"cordino\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"tocantinopolis ec\", None): (\"tocantinopolis\", \"to\"),\n    (\"toledo ec\", None): (\"toledo\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"sinop fc\", None): (\"sinop\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"sousa ec\", None): (\"sousa\", \"pb\"),\n    (\"urt\", None): (\"urt\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"urt mg\", None): (\"urt\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"nova mutum ec\", None): (\"nova mutum\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"tombense mg\", None): (\"tombense\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"tupi mg\", None): (\"tupi\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"nova venecia fc\", None): (\"nova venecia\", \"es\"),\n    (\"porto velho ec\", None): (\"porto velho\", \"ro\"),\n    (\"sc genus\", None): (\"genus\", \"ro\"),\n    (\"ce aimore\", None): (\"aimore\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ce dom bosco\", None): (\"dom bosco\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"ca votuporanguense\", None): (\"votuporanguense\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"campinense clube\", None): (\"campinense\", \"pb\"),\n    (\"cs alagoano\", None): (\"csa\", \"al\"),\n    (\"sete de setembro\", None): (\"7 de setembro\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"duque de caxias fc\", None): (\"duque de caxias\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"duque de caxias\", \"rj\"): (\"duque de caxias\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"uniao de rondonopolis\", None): (\"uniao rondonopolis\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"uniao\", \"mt\"): (\"uniao rondonopolis\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"brasil\", \"rs\"): (\"brasil de pelotas\", \"rs\"),  # Brasil de Pelotas\n    (\"brasil de pelotas\", None): (\"brasil de pelotas\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"brasilia fc\", None): (\"brasilia\", \"df\"),\n    (\"se gama\", None): (\"gama\", \"df\"),\n    (\"anapolis\", \"go\"): (\"anapolis fc\", \"go\"),\n    (\"sao jose poa\", None): (\"sao jose\", \"rs\"),  # \"São José - POA\" (Porto Alegre)\n    (\"xv piracicaba\", None): (\"xv de piracicaba\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sfrancisco\", \"pa\"): (\"sao francisco\", \"pa\"),  # \"S.francisco - PA\"\n    (\"tuntum ec\", None): (\"tuntum\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"palmas fr\", None): (\"palmas\", \"to\"),\n    (\"palmas ltda\", None): (\"palmas\", \"to\"),\n    (\"clube do remo\", None): (\"remo\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"remo pa\", None): (\"remo\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"retro fc brasil\", None): (\"retro\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"resende rj\", None): (\"resende\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"resende\", \"rj\"): (\"resende\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"caldense mg\", None): (\"caldense\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"aparecidense go\", None): (\"aparecidense\", \"go\"),\n    (\"ferroviaria sp\", None): (\"ferroviaria\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"ferroviario\", None): (\"ferroviario\", \"ce\"),  # bare BR-Football \"Ferroviário\" = CRF (CE)\n    (\"floresta ec\", None): (\"floresta\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"guarani de juazeiro\", None): (\"guarani de juazeiro\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"guarany de sobral\", None): (\"guarany de sobral\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"inter de limeira\", None): (\"inter de limeira\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"ge bage\", None): (\"bage\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ge gloria\", None): (\"gloria\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"coritiba pr\", None): (\"coritiba\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"cuiaba mt\", None): (\"cuiaba\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"caxias rs\", None): (\"caxias\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"internacional rs\", None): (\"internacional\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"gremio rs\", None): (\"gremio\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"santo andre sp\", None): (\"santo andre\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sao bernardo\", None): (\"sao bernardo\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sao bento\", None): (\"sao bento\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"confianca se\", None): (\"confianca\", \"se\"),\n    (\"operario\", \"pr\"): (\"operario\", \"pr\"),\n    # foreign clubs whose spelling varies inside the Libertadores file\n    (\"tolima\", None): (\"deportes tolima\", None),\n}\n\n#: States for bare, famous club names that are ambiguous in the data\n#: (the club's base appears with several different states).  Used both at\n#: registration time (for bare spellings in the files) and at query time.\nFAMOUS_STATE_HINTS: dict[str, str] = {\n    \"flamengo\": \"rj\",\n    \"fluminense\": \"rj\",\n    \"botafogo\": \"rj\",\n    \"vasco da gama\": \"rj\",\n    \"bangu\": \"rj\",\n    \"madureira\": \"rj\",\n    \"cabofriense\": \"rj\",\n    \"friburguense\": \"rj\",\n    \"volta redonda\": \"rj\",\n    \"nova iguacu\": \"rj\",\n    \"boavista\": \"rj\",\n    \"resende\": \"rj\",\n    \"marica\": \"rj\",\n    \"palmeiras\": \"sp\",\n    \"corinthians\": \"sp\",\n    \"sao paulo\": \"sp\",\n    \"santos\": \"sp\",\n    \"portuguesa\": \"sp\",\n    \"ponte preta\": \"sp\",\n    \"guarani\": \"sp\",\n    \"barueri\": \"sp\",\n    \"novorizontino\": \"sp\",\n    \"sao caetano\": \"sp\",\n    \"santo andre\": \"sp\",\n    \"ituano\": \"sp\",\n    \"oeste\": \"sp\",\n    \"linense\": \"sp\",\n    \"mirassol\": \"sp\",\n    \"marilia\": \"sp\",\n    \"mogi mirim\": \"sp\",\n    \"guaratingueta\": \"sp\",\n    \"audax\": \"sp\",\n    \"gremio\": \"rs\",\n    \"internacional\": \"rs\",\n    \"juventude\": \"rs\",\n    \"caxias\": \"rs\",\n    \"sao luiz\": \"rs\",\n    \"sao jose\": \"rs\",\n    \"lajeadense\": \"rs\",\n    \"novo hamburgo\": \"rs\",\n    \"esportivo\": \"rs\",\n    \"cruzeiro\": \"mg\",\n    \"atletico\": \"mg\",\n    \"america\": \"mg\",\n    \"ipatinga\": \"mg\",\n    \"tombense\": \"mg\",\n    \"tupi\": \"mg\",\n    \"urt\": \"mg\",\n    \"uberlandia\": \"mg\",\n    \"democrata gv\": \"mg\",\n    \"pouso alegre\": \"mg\",\n    \"athletic club\": \"mg\",\n    \"villa nova\": \"mg\",\n    \"vila nova\": \"go\",\n    \"sport\": \"pe\",\n    \"nautico\": \"pe\",\n    \"santa cruz\": \"pe\",\n    \"salgueiro\": \"pe\",\n    \"retro\": \"pe\",\n    \"central caruaru\": \"pe\",\n    \"bahia\": \"ba\",\n    \"vitoria\": \"ba\",\n    \"bahia de feira\": \"ba\",\n    \"juazeirense\": \"ba\",\n    \"jacuipense\": \"ba\",\n    \"vitoria da conquista\": \"ba\",\n    \"ceara\": \"ce\",\n    \"fortaleza\": \"ce\",\n    \"ferroviario\": \"ce\",\n    \"icasa\": \"ce\",\n    \"iguatu\": \"ce\",\n    \"floresta\": \"ce\",\n    \"barbalha\": \"ce\",\n    \"coritiba\": \"pr\",\n    \"parana\": \"pr\",\n    \"athletico paranaense\": \"pr\",\n    \"londrina\": \"pr\",\n    \"maringa\": \"pr\",\n    \"cianorte\": \"pr\",\n    \"foz do iguacu\": \"pr\",\n    \"azuriz\": \"pr\",\n    \"operario\": \"pr\",\n    \"chapecoense\": \"sc\",\n    \"avai\": \"sc\",\n    \"criciuma\": \"sc\",\n    \"figueirense\": \"sc\",\n    \"joinville\": \"sc\",\n    \"brusque\": \"sc\",\n    \"tubarao\": \"sc\",\n    \"camboriu\": \"sc\",\n    \"marcilio dias\": \"sc\",\n    \"metropolitano\": \"sc\",\n    \"goias\": \"go\",\n    \"goianesia\": \"go\",\n    \"anapolina\": \"go\",\n    \"cuiaba\": \"mt\",\n    \"mixto\": \"mt\",\n    \"luverdense\": \"mt\",\n    \"sinop\": \"mt\",\n    \"nova mutum\": \"mt\",\n    \"uniao rondonopolis\": \"mt\",\n    \"cem\": \"ms\",\n    \"aquidauanense\": \"ms\",\n    \"costa rica\": \"ms\",\n    \"comercial ms\": \"ms\",\n    \"novoperario\": \"ms\",\n    \"corumbaense\": \"ms\",\n    \"agua boa\": \"ms\",\n    \"csa\": \"al\",\n    \"crb\": \"al\",\n    \"asa\": \"al\",\n    \"murici\": \"al\",\n    \"coruripe\": \"al\",\n    \"santa rita\": \"al\",\n    \"paysandu\": \"pa\",\n    \"remo\": \"pa\",\n    \"independente\": \"pa\",\n    \"aguia de maraba\": \"pa\",\n    \"castanhal\": \"pa\",\n    \"parauapebas\": \"pa\",\n    \"sao raimundo\": \"pa\",\n    \"gurupi\": \"to\",\n    \"tocantinopolis\": \"to\",\n    \"palmas\": \"to\",\n    \"interporto\": \"to\",\n    \"tuna luso\": \"pa\",\n    \"brasiliense\": \"df\",\n    \"gama\": \"df\",\n    \"luziania\": \"df\",\n    \"sobradinho\": \"df\",\n    \"ceilandia\": \"df\",\n    \"santa quiteria\": \"ma\",\n    \"sampaio correa\": \"ma\",\n    \"moto club\": \"ma\",\n    \"imperatriz\": \"ma\",\n    \"cordino\": \"ma\",\n    \"maranhao\": \"ma\",\n    \"tuntum\": \"ma\",\n    \"confianca\": \"se\",\n    \"itabaiana\": \"se\",\n    \"sergipe\": \"se\",\n    \"lagarto\": \"se\",\n    \"estanciano\": \"se\",\n    \"frei paulistano\": \"se\",\n    \"amadense\": \"se\",\n    \"treze\": \"pb\",\n    \"campinense\": \"pb\",\n    \"sousa\": \"pb\",\n    \"souza\": \"pb\",\n    \"abc\": \"rn\",\n    \"america rn\": \"rn\",\n    \"globo\": \"rn\",\n    \"potiguar\": \"rn\",\n    \"palmeiras norte\": \"rn\",\n    \"santa cruz rn\": \"rn\",\n    \"nautico rr\": \"rr\",\n    \"real rr\": \"rr\",\n    \"sao raimundo rr\": \"rr\",\n    \"atletico acreano\": \"ac\",\n    \"galvez\": \"ac\",\n    \"humaita\": \"ac\",\n    \"rio branco\": \"ac\",\n    \"nacional am\": \"am\",\n    \"manaus\": \"am\",\n    \"penarol am\": \"am\",\n    \"fast clube\": \"am\",\n    \"princesa do solimoes\": \"am\",\n    \"amazonas\": \"am\",\n    \"porto velho\": \"ro\",\n    \"real ariquemes\": \"ro\",\n    \"rondoniense\": \"ro\",\n    \"genus\": \"ro\",\n    \"vilhena\": \"ro\",\n    \"ji parana\": \"ro\",\n    \"espigao\": \"ro\",\n    \"opera\": \"ro\",\n    \"sao raimundo am\": \"am\",\n    \"nacional\": \"am\",  # bare \"Nacional\" in Cup data = Nacional-AM (Manaus)\n    \"guarany de sobral\": \"ce\",\n    \"altos\": \"pi\",\n    \"picos\": \"pi\",\n    \"parnahyba\": \"pi\",\n    \"river\": \"pi\",\n    \"flamengo piaui\": \"pi\",\n    \"4 de julho\": \"pi\",\n    \"sao francisco pa\": \"pa\",\n}\n\n#: Popular nicknames accepted as queries (not present in the raw data).\nNICKNAMES: dict[str, str] = {\n    \"fla\": \"flamengo rj\",\n    \"flu\": \"fluminense rj\",\n    \"timao\": \"corinthians sp\",\n    \"verdao\": \"palmeiras sp\",\n    \"galo\": \"atletico mg\",\n    \"furacao\": \"atletico pr\",\n    \"vovo\": \"cruzeiro mg\",\n    \"peixe\": \"santos sp\",\n    \"sas\": \"vasco da gama rj\",\n    \"fogao\": \"botafogo rj\",\n    \"leao\": \"sport pe\",\n    \"coelho\": \"bangu rj\",\n    \"tricolor carioca\": \"fluminense rj\",\n    \"tricolor paulista\": \"sao paulo sp\",\n    \"mengao\": \"flamengo rj\",\n    \"nao\": \"nautico pe\",\n}\n\n\ndef canonical_team_name(raw: str, *, registry_states: dict[str, set[str]] | None = None) -> ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Fold a raw club spelling onto its canonical ``(base, state, country)``.\n\n    ``registry_states`` optionally maps a base to the set of states observed\n    for it across all files; it lets *bare* spellings of non-ambiguous clubs\n    inherit their state automatically (e.g. \"Coritiba\" -> PR because\n    \"Coritiba - PR\" exists elsewhere).\n    \"\"\"\n    parsed = parse_team_name(raw)\n    key = (parsed.base, parsed.state)\n    folded = ALIASES.get(key) or ALIASES.get((parsed.base, None))\n    if folded:\n        new_base, new_state = folded\n        state = parsed.state if new_state is None and parsed.country else new_state or parsed.state\n        if new_state is not None:\n            state = new_state\n        parsed = ParsedTeamName(base=new_base, state=state, country=parsed.country)\n\n    if parsed.state is None and parsed.country is None and registry_states is not None:\n        states = registry_states.get(parsed.base, set())\n        if len(states) == 1:\n            parsed = ParsedTeamName(base=parsed.base, state=next(iter(states)), country=None)\n        elif parsed.base in FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS:\n            parsed = ParsedTeamName(\n                base=parsed.base, state=FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS[parsed.base], country=None\n            )\n    elif parsed.state is None and parsed.country is None and parsed.base in FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS:\n        parsed = ParsedTeamName(base=parsed.base, state=FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS[parsed.base], country=None)\n    return parsed\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Competition normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass CompetitionDef:\n    \"\"\"Static competition metadata.\"\"\"\n\n    id: str\n    display: str\n    type: str  # \"league\" | \"cup\"\n    aliases: tuple[str, ...]\n\n\nCOMPETITIONS: dict[str, CompetitionDef] = {\n    \"serie_a\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_a\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série A\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\n            \"serie a\", \"série a\", \"brasileirao\", \"brasileirão\", \"brasileirao serie a\",\n            \"brasileirão série a\", \"campeonato brasileiro\", \"campeonato brasileiro serie a\",\n            \"brasileirao serie a (campeonato brasileiro)\", \"serie a (brasileirao)\",\n        ),\n    ),\n    \"serie_b\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_b\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série B\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\"serie b\", \"série b\", \"brasileirao serie b\", \"brasileirão série b\",\n                 \"campeonato brasileiro serie b\", \"segunda divisao\"),\n    ),\n    \"serie_c\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_c\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série C\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\"serie c\", \"série c\", \"brasileirao serie c\", \"brasileirão série c\",\n                 \"campeonato brasileiro serie c\", \"terceira divisao\"),\n    ),\n    \"copa_do_brasil\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"copa_do_brasil\",\n        display=\"Copa do Brasil\",\n        type=\"cup\",\n        aliases=(\"copa do brasil\", \"brazilian cup\", \"copa nacional\", \"cdb\"),\n    ),\n    \"libertadores\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"libertadores\",\n        display=\"Copa Libertadores\",\n        type=\"cup\",\n        aliases=(\"libertadores\", \"copa libertadores\", \"conmebol libertadores\",\n                 \"copa libertadores da america\", \"liberta\"),\n    ),\n}\n\n_COMP_LOOKUP: dict[str, str] = {}\nfor _comp in COMPETITIONS.values():\n    _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_comp.id)] = _comp.id\n    _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_comp.display)] = _comp.id\n    for _alias in _comp.aliases:\n        _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_alias)] = _comp.id\n\n\ndef normalize_competition(query: str | None) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"Map a free-text competition reference onto a competition id.\"\"\"\n    if not query:\n        return None\n    key = text_key(query)\n    if key in _COMP_LOOKUP:\n        return _COMP_LOOKUP[key]\n    for alias_key, comp_id in _COMP_LOOKUP.items():\n        if key and (alias_key in key or key in alias_key):\n            return comp_id\n    return None\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Date parsing / normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n_DATE_FORMATS = (\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", \"%Y-%m-%d\", \"%d/%m/%Y\", \"%d/%m/%Y %H:%M\")\n\n\ndef parse_date_any(value: str | None) -> date | None:\n    \"\"\"Parse ISO, ISO+time and Brazilian (DD/MM/YYYY) date strings.\n\n    Returns ``None`` for empty values and the \"NA\" sentinel used by the\n    Libertadores file.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not value:\n        return None\n    text = value.strip()\n    if not text or text.upper() == \"NA\":\n        return None\n    for fmt in _DATE_FORMATS:\n        try:\n            return datetime.strptime(text, fmt).date()\n        except ValueError:\n            continue\n    return None\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Player-position normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nPOSITION_GROUPS: dict[str, tuple[str, ...]] = {\n    \"GK\": (\"GK\",),\n    \"DEF\": (\"CB\", \"LCB\", \"RCB\", \"LB\", \"RB\", \"LWB\", \"RWB\"),\n    \"MID\": (\"CDM\", \"LDM\", \"RDM\", \"CM\", \"LCM\", \"RCM\", \"CAM\", \"LAM\", \"RAM\", \"LM\", \"RM\"),\n    \"FWD\": (\"ST\", \"LS\", \"RS\", \"CF\", \"LW\", \"RW\", \"LF\", \"RF\"),\n}\n\n_GROUP_BY_POSITION = {\n    position: group for group, positions in POSITION_GROUPS.items() for position in positions\n}\n\n\ndef position_group(position: str | None) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"Map a raw FIFA position code to its group (GK/DEF/MID/FWD).\"\"\"\n    if not position:\n        return None\n    return _GROUP_BY_POSITION.get(position.strip().upper())\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868/soccer_mcp/normalize.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"soccer_mcp/normalize.py","time":{"start":1788250967855,"end":1788250967863}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_05c104f29001Y1T1xSDUFRWd5g","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","messageID":"msg_05c0dba3f001ypHlrNmyS7FrX1"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1788250968033,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"id":"prt_05c104fdf001m8sFaKezyYB8Yj","reason":"tool-calls","snapshot":"492dbf879eb2a87c2b1ae0428afa59a0fec044cf","messageID":"msg_05c0dba3f001ypHlrNmyS7FrX1","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":163619,"input":3535,"output":7892,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":0,"read":152192}},"cost":0.07924372}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1788250976902,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"id":"prt_05c107274001T5zYWb5dsuIfL2","messageID":"msg_05c10508f001Ho9Ka58BEne7mW","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","snapshot":"36e8728c0d2dc30d247ba7fc976fd513f67f2626","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1788251234141,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"id":"prt_05c12e0a8001i1NF4uXsRY9bcS","messageID":"msg_05c10508f001Ho9Ka58BEne7mW","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","type":"text","text":"Let me refine `normalize.py` — I spotted bugs in the alias-fallback logic and several dead/wrong hint entries. Rewriting it cleanly:","time":{"start":1788251136168,"end":1788251234140}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788251234165,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_604f060a2a8d416292c1402f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"\nsoccer_mcp.normalize -- name, competition, date and position normalization.\n\nCONTEXT\n-------\nThis module implements the \"Data Quality\" requirements of the Brazilian Soccer\nMCP Server specification (TASK.md / brazilian-soccer-mcp-guide.md):\n\n* Team names appear in the six Kaggle CSV files under wildly different\n  conventions:\n      - with a state suffix ............. \"Palmeiras-SP\", \"América - MG\"\n      - without a suffix ................ \"Palmeiras\", \"Flamengo\"\n      - with dot-separated initials ..... \"A.b.c. - RN\", \"C.r.b. - AL\"\n      - with full legal names ........... \"Sport Club Corinthians Paulista\"\n      - with parenthetical remarks ...... \"Boavista Sport Club (antigo ...)\"\n      - foreign clubs with country tags . \"Nacional (URU)\", \"Barcelona-EQU\"\n  Every raw spelling must fold onto ONE canonical team id so that match\n  records from different files can be joined.\n\n* Dates appear as ISO (\"2023-09-24\"), ISO+time (\"2012-05-19 18:30:00\") and\n  Brazilian (\"29/03/2003\") formats, plus the sentinel \"NA\".\n\n* Competitions are referred to by many names (\"Brasileirão\", \"Serie A\",\n  \"Campeonato Brasileiro\", \"Copa do Brasil\", \"Libertadores\", ...).\n\nDESIGN\n------\n``parse_team_name`` decomposes a raw club name into ``(base, state, country)``\nvia a strict, order-sensitive pipeline (parenthetical extraction, country-tag\nextraction, trailing-UF extraction, accent folding, punctuation cleanup,\nsingle-letter-run collapsing).  An explicit ``ALIASES`` table then folds known\nhistorical/branding renames (e.g. \"Athletico Paranaense\" -> Atlético-PR,\n\"Grêmio Prudente\" -> Barueri).  States for *bare* spellings are auto-derived\nby the TeamRegistry in ``data_loader`` (a base observed with exactly one state\ninherits it, e.g. \"Coritiba\" -> PR); the small set of bases observed with\nseveral states is resolved through ``FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS`` (e.g. \"Flamengo\" ->\nRJ rather than PI).  Canonical ids look like ``\"flamengo rj\"``,\n``\"atletico pr\"`` or ``\"nacional uru\"``.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport unicodedata\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom datetime import date, datetime\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Basic text helpers\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\ndef strip_accents(value: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Return ``value`` with combining marks removed (NFD + Mn filtering).\"\"\"\n    decomposed = unicodedata.normalize(\"NFD\", value)\n    return \"\".join(ch for ch in decomposed if unicodedata.category(ch) != \"Mn\")\n\n\ndef text_key(value: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Case/accent-insensitive lookup key used for fuzzy name search.\"\"\"\n    return re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", strip_accents(value).casefold()).strip()\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Team-name parsing\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n#: The 27 Brazilian federal-unit (UF) abbreviations.\nVALID_UFS = {\n    \"ac\", \"al\", \"ap\", \"am\", \"ba\", \"ce\", \"df\", \"es\", \"go\", \"ma\", \"mt\", \"ms\",\n    \"mg\", \"pa\", \"pb\", \"pr\", \"pe\", \"pi\", \"rj\", \"rn\", \"rs\", \"ro\", \"rr\", \"sc\",\n    \"sp\", \"se\", \"to\",\n}\n\n#: Full state names sometimes written in parentheses, e.g. \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\".\nSTATE_NAMES = {\n    \"minas gerais\": \"mg\",\n    \"sao paulo\": \"sp\",\n    \"rio de janeiro\": \"rj\",\n    \"rio grande do sul\": \"rs\",\n    \"rio grande do norte\": \"rn\",\n    \"santa catarina\": \"sc\",\n    \"bahia\": \"ba\",\n    \"ceara\": \"ce\",\n    \"goias\": \"go\",\n    \"para\": \"pa\",\n    \"parana\": \"pr\",\n    \"pernambuco\": \"pe\",\n    \"piaui\": \"pi\",\n    \"maranhao\": \"ma\",\n    \"mato grosso\": \"mt\",\n    \"mato grosso do sul\": \"ms\",\n    \"amazonas\": \"am\",\n    \"paraiba\": \"pb\",\n    \"sergipe\": \"se\",\n    \"alagoas\": \"al\",\n    \"espirito santo\": \"es\",\n    \"distrito federal\": \"df\",\n    \"acre\": \"ac\",\n    \"amapa\": \"ap\",\n    \"rondonia\": \"ro\",\n    \"roraima\": \"rr\",\n    \"tocantins\": \"to\",\n}\n\n#: South/Latin-American country codes used as suffixes in the Libertadores file.\nCOUNTRY_CODES = {\"uru\", \"par\", \"equ\", \"per\", \"ven\", \"arg\", \"chi\", \"col\", \"bol\", \"mex\", \"ecu\"}\n\n_RE_TRAILING_PAREN = re.compile(r\"\\(([^)]*)\\)\\s*$\")\n_RE_COUNTRY_SUFFIX = re.compile(r\"[-\\u2013]\\s*([A-Za-z]{3})$\")\n_RE_STATE_SUFFIX = re.compile(r\"(?:^|\\s|[-\\u2013])\\s*([A-Za-z]{2})\\s*$\")\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Decomposed raw club name.\"\"\"\n\n    base: str\n    state: str | None\n    country: str | None\n\n    @property\n    def team_id(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Canonical id: ``\"<base> <state|country>\"`` (or bare base).\"\"\"\n        suffix = self.state or self.country\n        return f\"{self.base} {suffix}\" if suffix else self.base\n\n\ndef _collapse_single_letter_runs(base: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Join consecutive single-letter tokens: ``\"c r b\" -> \"crb\"``.\n\n    Dot-separated abbreviations (\"C. R. B.\", \"A.b.c.\") lose their dots in\n    ``_clean_base`` and end up as runs of one-letter tokens; they must fold to\n    a single token so they match their undotted spellings (\"CRB\", \"ABC\").\n    \"\"\"\n    tokens = base.split(\" \")\n    out: list[str] = []\n    run: list[str] = []\n    for token in tokens:\n        if len(token) == 1:\n            run.append(token)\n            continue\n        if run:\n            out.append(\"\".join(run))\n            run = []\n        out.append(token)\n    if run:\n        out.append(\"\".join(run))\n    return \" \".join(out)\n\n\ndef _clean_base(raw: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Lowercase, accent-folded, punctuation-normalized club base name.\"\"\"\n    text = strip_accents(raw).casefold().strip()\n    text = text.replace(\".\", \"\")  # \"a.b.c.\" -> \"abc\", \"s.francisco\" -> \"sfrancisco\"\n    text = re.sub(r\"[^\\w\\s]\", \" \", text)  # hyphens, apostrophes, etc. -> spaces\n    text = re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", text).strip()\n    return _collapse_single_letter_runs(text)\n\n\ndef parse_team_name(raw: str) -> ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Decompose a raw club spelling into ``base`` / ``state`` / ``country``.\n\n    Order of operations (important -- suffixes must be peeled off before the\n    base is cleaned):\n\n    1. trailing parenthetical: a 2-letter UF (\"(PI)\"), a state name\n       (\"(Minas Gerais)\") or a country code (\"(URU)\") is promoted to\n       ``state``/``country``; anything else (e.g. \"(antigo Esporte Clube\n       Barreira)\") is dropped;\n    2. trailing ``-XXX`` country tag (\"Barcelona-EQU\");\n    3. trailing 2-letter UF (\"Palmeiras-SP\", \"América - MG\", \"Botafogo PB\").\n    \"\"\"\n    text = raw.strip()\n    state: str | None = None\n    country: str | None = None\n\n    match = _RE_TRAILING_PAREN.search(text)\n    if match:\n        inner = strip_accents(match.group(1)).casefold().strip()\n        text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n        if inner in VALID_UFS:\n            state = inner\n        elif inner in STATE_NAMES:\n            state = STATE_NAMES[inner]\n        elif inner in COUNTRY_CODES:\n            country = inner\n\n    if country is None:\n        match = _RE_COUNTRY_SUFFIX.search(text)\n        if match and match.group(1).casefold() in COUNTRY_CODES:\n            country = match.group(1).casefold()\n            text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n\n    if state is None and country is None:\n        match = _RE_STATE_SUFFIX.search(text)\n        if match and match.group(1).casefold() in VALID_UFS:\n            state = match.group(1).casefold()\n            text = text[: match.start()].strip()\n\n    return ParsedTeamName(base=_clean_base(text), state=state, country=country)\n\n\n#: Explicit folds for clubs whose *base* itself changes between sources.\n#: Keys are ``(base, state_or_None)``; a ``None`` key state means \"bare\n#: spelling only\".  Values are the canonical ``(base, state)``.\nALIASES: dict[tuple[str, str | None], tuple[str, str | None]] = {\n    # -- Atlético family -----------------------------------------------------\n    (\"atletico mineiro\", None): (\"atletico\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"atletico goianiense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"go\"),\n    (\"atletico paranaense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"athletico paranaense\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"athletico\", None): (\"atletico\", \"pr\"),  # bare \"Athletico\" (Libertadores) = Athletico-PR\n    (\"atletico acreano\", None): (\"atletico\", \"ac\"),\n    (\"atletico alagoinhas\", None): (\"atletico\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"fc atletico cearense\", None): (\"atletico cearense\", \"ce\"),\n    # -- América family -------------------------------------------------------\n    (\"america fc\", \"mg\"): (\"america\", \"mg\"),  # FIFA \"América FC (Minas Gerais)\"\n    (\"america fc natal\", None): (\"america\", \"rn\"),\n    (\"america de natal\", None): (\"america\", \"rn\"),\n    # -- Rio / São Paulo classics ---------------------------------------------\n    (\"vasco\", None): (\"vasco da gama\", None),\n    (\"sport club corinthians paulista\", None): (\"corinthians\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sport recife\", None): (\"sport\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"sport club do recife\", None): (\"sport\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"gremio prudente\", None): (\"barueri\", \"sp\"),  # Barueri was renamed Grêmio Prudente in 2010\n    (\"gremio barueri\", None): (\"barueri\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"gremio novorizontino\", None): (\"novorizontino\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"bragantino\", None): (\"red bull bragantino\", \"sp\"),  # modern bare \"Bragantino\" = RB Bragantino-SP\n    (\"bragantino\", \"sp\"): (\"red bull bragantino\", \"sp\"),\n    # -- clubs whose full/legal name appears in some sources --------------------\n    (\"ser caxias\", None): (\"caxias\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ceara sporting club\", None): (\"ceara\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"nautico capibaribe\", None): (\"nautico\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"santa cruz fc\", None): (\"santa cruz\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"ec vitoria\", None): (\"vitoria\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"vitoria ec\", None): (\"vitoria\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"ec juventude\", None): (\"juventude\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ec internacional\", \"sc\"): (\"internacional\", \"sc\"),\n    (\"portuguesa desportos\", None): (\"portuguesa\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"macae esporte\", None): (\"macae\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"esportivo bento goncalves\", None): (\"esportivo\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"boavista sport club\", None): (\"boavista\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"boavista sc saquarema\", None): (\"boavista\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"operario ferroviario esporte c\", None): (\"operario\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"operario fc\", \"ms\"): (\"operario\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"ceo varzeagrandense\", None): (\"operario\", \"ms\"),  # historic name of Operário-MS\n    (\"aquidauanense futebol clube\", None): (\"aquidauanense\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"parnahyba sc\", \"pi\"): (\"parnahyba\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"rio branco vn\", None): (\"rio branco\", \"es\"),\n    (\"independente de tucurui\", None): (\"independente\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"santa quiteria futebol clube\", None): (\"santa quiteria\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"sao domingos futebol clube\", None): (\"sao domingos\", \"se\"),\n    (\"arapongas esporte clube\", None): (\"arapongas\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"paulista futebol clube\", None): (\"paulista\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"desportiva ferroviaria\", None): (\"desportiva\", \"es\"),\n    (\"real noroeste capixaba\", None): (\"real noroeste\", \"es\"),\n    (\"flamengo do piaui\", None): (\"flamengo\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"fluminense de feira\", None): (\"fluminense\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"fortaleza fc\", None): (\"fortaleza\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"fortaleza ec\", None): (\"fortaleza\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"vitoria fc\", \"es\"): (\"vitoria\", \"es\"),\n    (\"vitoria da conquista\", None): (\"vitoria da conquista\", \"ba\"),\n    (\"madureira ec\", None): (\"madureira\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"moto club de sao luis\", None): (\"moto club\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"moto clube\", None): (\"moto club\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"afogados da ingazeira\", None): (\"afogados\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"aguia\", \"pa\"): (\"aguia de maraba\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"ae altos\", None): (\"altos\", \"pi\"),\n    (\"ad confianca\", None): (\"confianca\", \"se\"),\n    (\"ad frei paulistano\", None): (\"frei paulistano\", \"se\"),\n    (\"amadense ec\", None): (\"amadense\", \"se\"),\n    (\"cordino ec\", None): (\"cordino\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"tocantinopolis ec\", None): (\"tocantinopolis\", \"to\"),\n    (\"toledo ec\", None): (\"toledo\", \"pr\"),\n    (\"sinop fc\", None): (\"sinop\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"sousa ec\", None): (\"sousa\", \"pb\"),\n    (\"urt mg\", None): (\"urt\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"nova mutum ec\", None): (\"nova mutum\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"tombense mg\", None): (\"tombense\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"tupi mg\", None): (\"tupi\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"nova venecia fc\", None): (\"nova venecia\", \"es\"),\n    (\"porto velho ec\", None): (\"porto velho\", \"ro\"),\n    (\"sc genus\", None): (\"genus\", \"ro\"),\n    (\"ce aimore\", None): (\"aimore\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ce dom bosco\", None): (\"dom bosco\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"ca votuporanguense\", None): (\"votuporanguense\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"ca taguatinga\", None): (\"taguatinga\", \"df\"),\n    (\"campinense clube\", None): (\"campinense\", \"pb\"),\n    (\"cs alagoano\", None): (\"csa\", \"al\"),\n    (\"sete de setembro\", None): (\"7 de setembro\", \"ms\"),\n    (\"duque de caxias fc\", None): (\"duque de caxias\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"uniao de rondonopolis\", None): (\"uniao rondonopolis\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"uniao\", \"mt\"): (\"uniao rondonopolis\", \"mt\"),\n    (\"brasil\", \"rs\"): (\"brasil de pelotas\", \"rs\"),  # \"Brasil - RS\" = Brasil de Pelotas\n    (\"brasilia fc\", None): (\"brasilia\", \"df\"),\n    (\"se gama\", None): (\"gama\", \"df\"),\n    (\"anapolis\", \"go\"): (\"anapolis fc\", \"go\"),\n    (\"sao jose poa\", None): (\"sao jose\", \"rs\"),  # \"São José - POA\" (Porto Alegre)\n    (\"xv piracicaba\", None): (\"xv de piracicaba\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"sfrancisco\", \"pa\"): (\"sao francisco\", \"pa\"),  # \"S.francisco - PA\"\n    (\"tuntum ec\", None): (\"tuntum\", \"ma\"),\n    (\"palmas fr\", None): (\"palmas\", \"to\"),\n    (\"palmas ltda\", None): (\"palmas\", \"to\"),\n    (\"clube do remo\", None): (\"remo\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"remo pa\", None): (\"remo\", \"pa\"),\n    (\"retro fc brasil\", None): (\"retro\", \"pe\"),\n    (\"resende rj\", None): (\"resende\", \"rj\"),\n    (\"caldense mg\", None): (\"caldense\", \"mg\"),\n    (\"aparecidense go\", None): (\"aparecidense\", \"go\"),\n    (\"ferroviaria sp\", None): (\"ferroviaria\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"ferroviario\", None): (\"ferroviario\", \"ce\"),  # bare \"Ferroviário\" = CRF (CE)\n    (\"floresta ec\", None): (\"floresta\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"guarani de juazeiro\", None): (\"guarani de juazeiro\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"guarany de sobral\", None): (\"guarany de sobral\", \"ce\"),\n    (\"inter de limeira\", None): (\"inter de limeira\", \"sp\"),\n    (\"ge bage\", None): (\"bage\", \"rs\"),\n    (\"ge gloria\", None): (\"gloria\", \"rs\"),\n    # foreign clubs whose spelling varies inside the Libertadores file\n    (\"tolima\", None): (\"deportes tolima\", None),\n}\n\n#: States for the handful of *ambiguous* famous bases (the same base exists\n#: with several states in the data).  Unambiguous bases inherit their state\n#: automatically from the registry, so they are not listed here.\nFAMOUS_STATE_HINTS: dict[str, str] = {\n    \"flamengo\": \"rj\",       # also Flamengo-PI exists\n    \"fluminense\": \"rj\",     # also Fluminense-BA / Fluminense-PI exist\n    \"botafogo\": \"rj\",       # also Botafogo-PB / Botafogo-SP exist\n    \"santos\": \"sp\",         # also Santos-AP exists\n    \"internacional\": \"rs\",  # also Internacional-SC exists\n    \"juventude\": \"rs\",      # also Juventude-MA exists\n    \"vitoria\": \"ba\",        # also Vitória-ES exists\n    \"nautico\": \"pe\",        # also Náutico-RR exists\n    \"santa cruz\": \"pe\",     # also Santa Cruz-RN / Santa Cruz-RS exist\n    \"guarani\": \"sp\",        # also Guarani-CE exists\n    \"portuguesa\": \"sp\",     # also Portuguesa-RJ exists\n}\n\n#: Popular nicknames accepted as queries (not present in the raw data).\nNICKNAMES: dict[str, str] = {\n    \"fla\": \"flamengo rj\",\n    \"mengao\": \"flamengo rj\",\n    \"flu\": \"fluminense rj\",\n    \"tricolor carioca\": \"fluminense rj\",\n    \"timao\": \"corinthians sp\",\n    \"verdao\": \"palmeiras sp\",\n    \"galo\": \"atletico mg\",\n    \"furacao\": \"atletico pr\",\n    \"peixe\": \"santos sp\",\n    \"fogao\": \"botafogo rj\",\n    \"leao\": \"sport pe\",\n    \"tricolor paulista\": \"sao paulo sp\",\n    \"nao\": \"nautico pe\",\n    \"raposa\": \"cruzeiro mg\",\n    \"vava\": \"vasco da gama rj\",\n}\n\n\ndef apply_aliases(parsed: ParsedTeamName) -> ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Fold known base-name renames onto the canonical base/state.\"\"\"\n    folded = ALIASES.get((parsed.base, parsed.state))\n    if folded is None and parsed.state is None and parsed.country is None:\n        folded = ALIASES.get((parsed.base, None))\n    if folded is None:\n        return parsed\n    new_base, new_state = folded\n    state = new_state if new_state is not None else parsed.state\n    return ParsedTeamName(base=new_base, state=state, country=parsed.country)\n\n\ndef canonical_team_name(raw: str, *, registry_states: dict[str, set[str]] | None = None) -> ParsedTeamName:\n    \"\"\"Fold a raw club spelling onto its canonical ``(base, state, country)``.\n\n    ``registry_states`` optionally maps a base to the set of states observed\n    for it across all files; it lets *bare* spellings of non-ambiguous clubs\n    inherit their state automatically (e.g. \"Coritiba\" -> PR because\n    \"Coritiba - PR\" exists elsewhere).  Ambiguous bases fall back to\n    ``FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS``.\n    \"\"\"\n    parsed = apply_aliases(parse_team_name(raw))\n    if parsed.state is not None or parsed.country is not None:\n        return parsed\n    states = registry_states.get(parsed.base, set()) if registry_states else set()\n    if len(states) == 1:\n        return ParsedTeamName(base=parsed.base, state=next(iter(states)), country=None)\n    hint = FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS.get(parsed.base)\n    if hint is not None:\n        return ParsedTeamName(base=parsed.base, state=hint, country=None)\n    return parsed\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Competition normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass CompetitionDef:\n    \"\"\"Static competition metadata.\"\"\"\n\n    id: str\n    display: str\n    type: str  # \"league\" | \"cup\"\n    aliases: tuple[str, ...]\n\n\nCOMPETITIONS: dict[str, CompetitionDef] = {\n    \"serie_a\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_a\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série A\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\n            \"serie a\", \"série a\", \"brasileirao\", \"brasileirão\", \"brasileirao serie a\",\n            \"brasileirão série a\", \"campeonato brasileiro\", \"campeonato brasileiro serie a\",\n            \"serie a (brasileirao)\", \"serie a brasileirao\",\n        ),\n    ),\n    \"serie_b\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_b\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série B\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\"serie b\", \"série b\", \"brasileirao serie b\", \"brasileirão série b\",\n                 \"campeonato brasileiro serie b\", \"segunda divisao\"),\n    ),\n    \"serie_c\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"serie_c\",\n        display=\"Brasileirão Série C\",\n        type=\"league\",\n        aliases=(\"serie c\", \"série c\", \"brasileirao serie c\", \"brasileirão série c\",\n                 \"campeonato brasileiro serie c\", \"terceira divisao\"),\n    ),\n    \"copa_do_brasil\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"copa_do_brasil\",\n        display=\"Copa do Brasil\",\n        type=\"cup\",\n        aliases=(\"copa do brasil\", \"brazilian cup\", \"copa nacional\", \"cdb\"),\n    ),\n    \"libertadores\": CompetitionDef(\n        id=\"libertadores\",\n        display=\"Copa Libertadores\",\n        type=\"cup\",\n        aliases=(\"libertadores\", \"copa libertadores\", \"conmebol libertadores\",\n                 \"copa libertadores da america\", \"liberta\"),\n    ),\n}\n\n_COMP_LOOKUP: dict[str, str] = {}\nfor _comp in COMPETITIONS.values():\n    _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_comp.id)] = _comp.id\n    _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_comp.display)] = _comp.id\n    for _alias in _comp.aliases:\n        _COMP_LOOKUP[text_key(_alias)] = _comp.id\n\n\ndef normalize_competition(query: str | None) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"Map a free-text competition reference onto a competition id.\"\"\"\n    if not query:\n        return None\n    key = text_key(query)\n    if key in _COMP_LOOKUP:\n        return _COMP_LOOKUP[key]\n    for alias_key, comp_id in _COMP_LOOKUP.items():\n        if alias_key and (alias_key in key or key in alias_key):\n            return comp_id\n    return None\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Date parsing / normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n_DATE_FORMATS = (\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", \"%Y-%m-%d\", \"%d/%m/%Y\", \"%d/%m/%Y %H:%M\")\n\n\ndef parse_date_any(value: str | None) -> date | None:\n    \"\"\"Parse ISO, ISO+time and Brazilian (DD/MM/YYYY) date strings.\n\n    Returns ``None`` for empty values and the \"NA\" sentinel used by the\n    Libertadores file.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not value:\n        return None\n    text = value.strip()\n    if not text or text.upper() == \"NA\":\n        return None\n    for fmt in _DATE_FORMATS:\n        try:\n            return datetime.strptime(text, fmt).date()\n        except ValueError:\n            continue\n    return None\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Player-position normalization\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nPOSITION_GROUPS: dict[str, tuple[str, ...]] = {\n    \"GK\": (\"GK\",),\n    \"DEF\": (\"CB\", \"LCB\", \"RCB\", \"LB\", \"RB\", \"LWB\", \"RWB\"),\n    \"MID\": (\"CDM\", \"LDM\", \"RDM\", \"CM\", \"LCM\", \"RCM\", \"CAM\", \"LAM\", \"RAM\", \"LM\", \"RM\"),\n    \"FWD\": (\"ST\", \"LS\", \"RS\", \"CF\", \"LW\", \"RW\", \"LF\", \"RF\"),\n}\n\n_GROUP_BY_POSITION = {\n    position: group for group, positions in POSITION_GROUPS.items() for position in positions\n}\n\n\ndef position_group(position: str | None) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"Map a raw FIFA position code to its group (GK/DEF/MID/FWD).\"\"\"\n    if not position:\n        return None\n    return _GROUP_BY_POSITION.get(position.strip().upper())\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868/soccer_mcp/normalize.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868/soccer_mcp/normalize.py","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"soccer_mcp/normalize.py","time":{"start":1788251234135,"end":1788251234162}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait, there's a bug in `canonical_team_name` — the fold logic is convoluted. Let me review:\n\n```python\nfolded = ALIASES.get(key) or ALIASES.get((parsed.base, None))\nif folded:\n    new_base, new_state = folded\n    state = parsed.state if new_state is None and parsed.country else new_state or parsed.state\n    if new_state is not None:\n        state = new_state\n    parsed = ParsedTeamName(base=new_base, state=state, country=parsed.country)\n```\n\nThe intent: if the alias provides a new_state → use it. If new_state is None → keep parsed.state. Let me simplify:\n\n```python\nif folded:\n    new_base, new_state = folded\n    state = new_state if new_state is not None else parsed.state\n    parsed = ParsedTeamName(base=new_base, state=state, country=parsed.country)\n```\n\nHmm wait — but there's a subtlety: alias key `(base, None)` means \"any state\". E.g. (\"atletico mineiro\", None) → (\"atletico\",\"mg\"). If someone wrote \"Atlético Mineiro\" without MG — we force mg ✓. If \"Atlético Mineiro - SP\" (nonsense) — forces mg anyway. Fine.\n\nBut there's a conflict: ALIASES has (\"bragantino\", None) → (\"red bull bragantino\",\"sp\") AND (\"bragantino\",\"sp\"). The (base, None) entry would also catch (\"bragantino\",\"pa\")! Because `ALIASES.get((parsed.base, None))` is a fallback for ANY state. That would wrongly fold Bragantino-PA → red bull bragantino sp. I need the None-key fallback to apply only when parsed.state is None. Let me fix:\n\n```python\nfolded = ALIASES.get((parsed.base, parsed.state))\nif folded is None and parsed.state is None:\n    folded = ALIASES.get((parsed.base, None))\n```\n\nWait but entries like (\"vitoria fc\", \"es\") exist — exact key with state ✓. And (\"america fc\",\"mg\") ✓. And (\"ferroviario\", None) → (\"ferroviario\",\"ce\") — bare Ferroviário → CRF-CE ✓. But (\"ferroviario\",\"ce\") exact — would fall to None-key... no: exact key (\"ferroviario\",\"ce\") not in table; then since state != None, no fallback → stays (\"ferroviario\",\"ce\") ✓ same result. Fine.\n\nBut hold on — (\"atletico\", None)? Not in table ✓ (we don't fold bare atletico).\n\nAlso `(\"operario\", \"pr\")` and `(\"operario\", None)`?? I have (\"operario ferroviario esporte c\", None) and (\"operario fc\", \"ms\") — but (\"operario\", None)? Not present — good, bare \"Oper