is dead code since parse strips \"PR\" → base \"coritiba\". REMOVE those.\n\nSimilarly (\"sao francisco pa\", None) in hints — base would be \"sao francisco\" not \"sao francisco pa\". Wrong — remove; and alias (\"sfrancisco\",\"pa\") handles the Cup spelling ✓.\n\n\"central caruaru\" hint — Cup 'Central - PE' → base \"central\" + pe → id \"central pe\". BR 'Central SC' → \"central sc\". hint key \"central caruaru\" — never matches. The base is just \"central\". Remove or set \"central\": \"pe\"? NO — central sc exists → ambiguous, leave disambiguation. Remove \"central caruaru\".\n\n\"cem\" hint ms — base \"cene\" from 'CENE MS' → base cene state ms — hint key \"cem\" wrong; remove (auto-inherit works: base \"cene\" states {ms} — wait BR 'CENE MS' → state ms ✓; any bare \"CENE\"? no → fine).\n\n\"agua boa\" — no such team; remove. \"opera\" — no such; remove. \"ji parana\" — Cup 'Ji-paraná - RO' → base \"ji parana\" state ro ✓ auto. remove hint. \"espigao\" → Cup 'Espigão - RO' → auto ✓ remove hint. \"rondoniense\" → auto ✓ remove. \"real ariquemes\" → BR only, no state → hint ro needed? auto: base \"real ariquemes\" states — none observed elsewhere → stays stateless ✓ fine, remove hint. \"vilhena\" → BR 'Vilhena RO' → state ro ✓ remove hint. \"porto velho\" → BR 'Porto Velho EC' → alias ✓ remove hint. \"genus\" → alias ✓ remove hint (\"genus\": \"ro\" — BR 'SC Genus' folded; Cup 'Genus - RO' → base genus state ro... auto handles; remove hint). \"nacional am\" hint — bare \"Nacional AM\" state-stripped → base nacional state am — id \"nacional am\" direct; remove hint (the \"nacional\" hint am stays). \"sao raimundo am\" — states pa, am, rr all observed via suffixed names; bare \"São Raimundo\"? Cup has 'São Raimundo - PA' and '- RR'; BR has 'Sao Raimundo AM/PA/RR' suffixed. No bare → remove hint. \"atletico acreano\" alias ✓ remove hint. \"galvez\" → Cup 'Galvez - AC' suffixed ✓ remove hint. \"humaita\" → BR only stateless → keep hint ac? \"Humaitá\" — hmm, which s