checks entities with same BASE — \"nacional am\", \"nacional uru\", \"nacional par\" — I'll handle: prefer Brazilian (state) entities over foreign; if exactly one Brazilian → use it. That's better than a hint! Implement in resolve: candidates split into Brazilian (state) vs foreign; unique Brazilian wins.\n\nSo the famous hints final list (ambiguous Brazilian bases only):\nflamengo→rj, fluminense→rj, botafogo→rj, santos→sp, internacional→rs, juventude→rs, vitoria→ba, nautico→pe, santa cruz→pe, guarani→sp, bahia? {ba} single → auto. sport? single. \n\nPlus ones ambiguous where data-hint is safe & famous: \"america\"→? skip. \"atletico\"→? skip. \n\nAlso \"bragantino\" bare handled by alias ✓. \n\nHmm wait — \"vasco da gama\" — bare \"Vasco\" → alias → (\"vasco da gama\", None) → states {rj} auto → rj ✓.\n\nAnd \"gremio\" {rs} auto ✓. \"cruzeiro\" {mg} auto ✓. \"palmeiras\" {sp} auto ✓. \"corinthians\" {sp} auto ✓. \"sao paulo\" {sp} auto ✓. \"portuguesa\" {sp, rj} → hint sp! Portuguesa-RJ (Cup 'Portuguesa - RJ'? wait Cup list has no Portuguesa RJ... BR-Football has 'Portuguesa RJ'! yes it does). So portuguesa {sp, rj} → hint sp ✓ keep.\n\"ponte preta\" {sp} auto. \"santo andre\" {sp} auto. \"sao caetano\" {sp} auto. \"brasiliense\" {df} auto. \"ipatinga\" {mg} auto. \"barueri\" {sp} auto. \"coritiba\" {pr} auto. \"parana\" {pr} auto. \"chapecoense\" {sc} auto. \"avai\" {sc} auto. \"criciuma\" {sc} auto. \"figueirense\" {sc} auto. \"joinville\" {sc} auto. \"goias\" {go} auto. \"cuiaba\" {mt} auto. \"ceara\" {ce} auto. \"fortaleza\" {ce} auto. \"bahia\" {ba} auto. \"cruzeiro\" auto. \n\nSo FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS final: {flamengo: rj, fluminense: rj, botafogo: rj, santos: sp, internacional: rs, juventude: rs, vitoria: ba, nautico: pe, santa cruz: pe, guarani: sp, portuguesa: sp}.\n\nEverything else auto. \n\nAlso NICKNAMES — I included a bunch. \"coelho\"→bangu? Coelho is actually Botafogo's nickname (Botafogo-PB? no...). Hmm — \"Coelho\" is the nickname of Bangu? No! \"Coelho\" = América-MG's nickname! And Botafogo = \"Estrela Solitária\". Let me drop dubious nicknames: keep only very safe ones: fla, flu, timao, verdao, galo, furacao, vovo (Cruzeiro? \"Raposa\" is Cruzeiro! \"Vovô\" is Criciúma?? no — Vovô = Criciúma... hmm, actually \"Vovô\" is the nickname of Criciúma EC. Cruzeiro = Raposa). Drop vovo. peixe (Santos) ✓, mengao ✓, fogao (Botafogo) ✓, leao (Sport) ✓ — hmm \"Leão\" is also São Paulo's mascot... Sport = \"Leão da Ilha\" ✓ keep. Drop coelho, sas, tricolor carioca (flu ✓ keep), tricolor paulista (são paulo ✓), nao (Náutico ✓ keep). Drop \"galo\"? Galo = Atlético-MG ✓ keep. Drop \"verdao\"→palmeiras ✓ (also Ponte Preta is \"Macaca\", Palmeiras = Verdão ✓). furacao = Athletico-PR ✓ (also Atlético-PR historic). OK.\n\nAlso — \"sao bernardo\" hint sp — auto ({sp} only? Cup 'Sao Bernardo - SP' ✓ single) → remove hint.\n\nLet me now rewrite normalize.py more carefully with these fixes:\n1. Simplified/corrected fold lookup (exact (base,state) first; (base,None) only when state is None).\n2. Cleaned FAMOUS_STATE_HINTS.\n3. Cleaned ALIASES (removed dead/wrong entries, added fc atletico cearense, ca taguatinga).\n4. Keep STATE_NAMES, country codes, etc.\n\nAlso in canonical_team_name, the registry_states logic: apply when stateless: unique → inherit; multiple → famous hint; none → stateless. And remove the duplicated elif branch.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c145f5100143VMooP1PvSy4f","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","messageID":"msg_05c10508f001Ho9Ka58BEne7mW"}}
