2020: 120/120 ✓. 2021: 92/132=0.697 → br_football. 2022-2023: br_football only.\n\nSo copa 2016 → br_football. Is that right? Check br_football 2016 copa completeness: does it include the final (Dec 2016)? The 2016 CdB final: Grêmio vs Atlético-MG (Dec 2016, two legs). Let me check br_football for those matches and also cup file 2016 round 7 = final? Let me look at data.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c219d49001Fwl96JejaFhwXP","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","messageID":"msg_05c20b826001xOco1io6Fj2UiW"}}
