(...)` — my Scenario.and_ signature is `and_(description, assertion)` — matches ✓. But in `test_parenthetical...` I used `.and_` after `.then` ✓ fine.\n\nFix the date test.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c30d4b1001x1LYjKpEO0Mdrj","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","messageID":"msg_05c309a5b001tYxYnINlmwvDAQ"}}
