{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788254190496,"sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_c3d5adb2baf848f9a699cdcc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868 && python - << 'EOF'\nfor path in [\"soccer_mcp/queries.py\", \"soccer_mcp/tools.py\"]:\n    src = open(path).read()\n    src = src.replace(\"min_matches: int = 20,\", \"min_matches: int = 10,\")\n    src = src.replace(\"fewer than min_matches (default 20) in the filter are skipped.\",\n                      \"fewer than min_matches (default 10) in the filter are skipped.\")\n    open(path, \"w\").write(src)\nprint(\"done\")\nEOF"},"output":"done\n","metadata":{"output":"done\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-e48763b54868 && python - << 'EOF'\nfor path in [\"soccer_mcp/queries.py\", \"soccer_mcp/tools.py\"]:\n    src = open(path).read()\n    src = src.replace(\"min_matches: int = 20,\", \"min_matches: int = 10,\")\n    src = src.replace(\"fewer than min_matches (default 20) in the filter are skipped.\",\n                      \"fewer than min_matches (default 10) in the filter are skipped.\")\n    open(path, \"w\").write(src)\nprint(\"done\")\nEOF","time":{"start":1788254190492,"end":1788254190494}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Almost all perfect! One issue: `best_records(venue=\"away\", competition=\"Brasileirão\", season=2023)` returns \"No teams meet the minimum match threshold.\" — min_matches default is 20, but away matches per team in one season = 19 < 20! The default threshold is wrong for single-season venue queries. Fix: default min_matches should scale — or lower default to 10, and document. Actually 20 made sense for \"overall\" across a season (38 matches). For venue splits per season it's 19. Set default min_matches=10 in the tool (and query). For overall career-level queries the ranking is still meaningful with ≥10. Let me change the default in both queries.best_records and tools.best_records to 10.\n\nWait — but with min_matches=10 for \"best away record in the dataset (all comps)\", small clubs with 10 away matches and 70% win rate (Serie C clubs) would top it... that's data-honest. The default in the tool docstring says 20 — update both to 10.\n\nAlso the Libertadores 2019 knockout bracket: River-Cruzeiro R16 0-0 agg — decided on penalties (Cruzeiro advanced in real life... whatever, bracket shows aggregates correctly; ties level on aggregate are shown without winner notes in knockout (only in finals). That's acceptable — the _tie_line shows the aggregate; a \"penalties\" note could be added but ties list doesn't say who advanced. Fine for a bracket view.\n\nNow update min_matches default, then README.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05c417b72001sJfG6fPLY0fS2F","sessionID":"ses_fa40f0460ffeYpKGnJPSwDwXVy","messageID":"msg_05c410cc7001EeRK5l636LYH52"}}
